# Arcane spells added in the completeness pass. Ratings: Damage, Control, Debuff, Buff/Heal, Positioning, Utility.
from spell_evals_base import E, s

# ───────────── Cantrips ─────────────
s('Gale Blast', '110020', 'C--', "Gale Blast hits every creature in a 5-foot emanation around Cyrus and pushes those that fail away from him. Pushing an adjacent enemy 5 feet puts it at 10 feet, which is where Aspera wants it, but the emanation also hits adjacent allies such as Mira and Cassius. Through Spellstrike it affects only the target, with a Fortitude save, which makes it a weak damage payload with a small repositioning rider.")
s('Puff of Poison', '300000', 'C--', "Puff of Poison is a Fortitude payload with persistent poison damage, so part of its damage keeps landing while Cyrus recharges. It only heightens every two ranks, and undead, constructs and many fiends are immune to poison, so Frostbite is the more dependable Fortitude cantrip.")
s('Spout', '301000', 'C--', "Spout is a basic Reflex payload that leaves a target off-guard on a critical failure, which turns on Laughing Shadow's damage for the next Strike. Its damage starts at 2d4 and rises by 1d4 per rank, which trails Gouging Claw and Ignition throughout the campaign.")
s('Slashing Gust', '200000', 'D--', "Slashing Gust requires a free hand, and two free hands to target two creatures. Cyrus would have to let go of Aspera to cast it, which means he can't Spellstrike with it and needs an action to regrip afterwards. Needle Darts covers ranged attacks without that cost.")
s('Timber', '200000', 'C--', "Timber is a 15-foot line from Cyrus's space with a basic Reflex save and dazzled on a critical failure. With Expansive Spellstrike the line starts next to the target, but its damage is low for a line, and Scatter Scree and Lightning Bolt cover the line role better.")
s('Phase Bolt', '300000', 'C--', "Phase Bolt is a 60-foot attack cantrip that reduces the target's circumstance bonuses to AC from shields and cover. Its damage starts close to Gouging Claw's but only rises by 1d4 per rank, so it falls behind. Through Spellstrike the attack roll is Aspera's Strike, so the shield and cover reduction is the main reason to choose it.")
s('Glass Shield', '000300', 'C--', "Glass Shield gives the same +1 AC as Shield and can block damage from any spell or magical effect, and the shards damage an adjacent creature that breaks it. Its Hardness is lower than Shield's at every rank, so Shield Block prevents less damage. Shield remains the better choice for a single defensive cantrip.")
s('Warp Step', '000010', 'D--', "Warp Step lets Cyrus Stride twice with a +5-foot status bonus. Laughing Shadow already gives him a status bonus to Speed, which doesn't stack, so in stance Warp Step is no better than two ordinary Strides.")
s('Light', '000003', 'B--', "Light creates a movable light that lasts until his next preparations. Cyrus is human and has no darkvision or low-light vision, so in dungeons and at night he depends on light. A torch or everburning torch does the same job without a cantrip slot, which is why it isn't a daily pick.")
s('Prestidigitation', '000002', 'C--', "Prestidigitation handles small tasks such as cleaning, warming food and making crude trinkets. It helps in court and social scenes where appearance matters, but it never changes the outcome of a challenge.")
s('Read Aura', '000003', 'B--', "Read Aura tells Cyrus whether an object is magical and gives a +2 bonus to Identify Magic on it, and its heightened versions check many objects at once. Cyrus is the party's best Arcana user, so he is the natural identifier. It takes a minute to cast, so it is for exploration only.")
s('Infectious Enthusiasm', '000100', 'D--', "Infectious Enthusiasm costs two actions for a +1 status bonus that lasts a round, and allies have to spend an action to share it. That is far too expensive for Cyrus, whose turns are built around Spellstrike and recharging.")

# ───────────── Rank 1 ─────────────
s('Acidic Burst', '300000', 'BCD', "Acidic Burst deals 2d6 acid per rank in a 5-foot emanation, one of the best damage-per-rank rates of any save spell. As a direct cast it hits adjacent allies, so it is a Spellstrike payload: through Spellstrike only the target is affected, with a basic Reflex save that still resolves if Aspera misses. Heightened, it competes well with Thunderstrike as a Reflex payload, and acid resistance is less common than fire or electricity resistance.")
s('Agitate', '021000', 'BCD', "Agitate forces the target to move at least once each turn or take mental damage, for one to four rounds depending on its save. A target that moves within Aspera's 10-foot reach can provoke Reactive Strike, so it pairs well with Cyrus's reaction from level 6. It does nothing against mindless creatures, and a target can satisfy it by stepping 5 feet.")
s('Alarm', '000003', 'CCB', "Alarm wards a campsite for eight hours. A wand of Alarm covers every rest of the campaign without using a slot, which is the most efficient way to carry it.")
s('Ant Haul', '000001', 'DDD', "Ant Haul adds carrying capacity for eight hours. Cyrus has high Strength, so he rarely needs it.")
s('Anticipate Peril', '000100', 'DDD', "Anticipate Peril gives a +1 status bonus to the target's next initiative roll. Cyrus already has Incredible Initiative, and the bonus is too small to justify a slot.")
s('Carryall', '000002', 'DDD', "Carryall floats up to 5 Bulk behind Cyrus for eight hours. It is useful for hauling treasure, but a bag of holding or a pack animal does the same job permanently.")
s('Charm', '000004', 'BBC', "Charm makes a creature friendly towards Cyrus for an hour, or helpful on a critical failure, and from rank 4 it lasts until his next preparations. In a roleplay-heavy campaign it can open doors that Diplomacy can't. The target gets a large bonus if the party has threatened it, it has the incapacitation trait, and a creature that realises it was charmed may become hostile, so it suits one-off encounters rather than relationships the party wants to keep.")
s('Chilling Spray', '220000', 'CCD', "Chilling Spray is a 15-foot cone that slows creatures that fail their Reflex save. It heightens by 2d4 per rank, which trails Breathe Fire's damage, and the cone is small. With Expansive Spellstrike it can catch a few grouped enemies, but Lightning Bolt replaces it from level 5.")
s('Déjà Vu', '030000', 'CDD', "Déjà Vu forces a creature to repeat its next turn's actions on the following turn. Against a monster that spent its turn moving into position, that can waste a whole turn, but against a creature that attacked it simply attacks again. It has the incapacitation trait, so it fails against strong enemies, and the outcome is hard to predict.")
s('Draw Ire', '111000', 'CDD', "Draw Ire deals mental damage and gives the target a penalty to attack anyone except Cyrus, even on a successful save. It can protect Yara or Theldren from an enemy that has reached them. Cyrus has middling AC for a front-liner, so drawing attacks to himself is only sensible when Mira can't.")
s('Echoing Weapon', '100000', 'DDD', "Echoing Weapon adds a little sonic damage for each successful Strike in a turn. Cyrus makes one or two Strikes a turn, so it adds 1 or 2 damage, far too little for a slot.")
s('Endure', '000100', 'DDD', "Endure grants 5 temporary Hit Points per rank for one action. The amount is small and it needs touch, so a rank-1 slot has better uses.")
s('Enfeeble', '003000', 'BCC', "Enfeeble makes the target enfeebled 1 even on a successful save, and enfeebled 2 for a minute on a failure. That lowers a brute's attack rolls, damage and Athletics, which protects Mira and Cassius. Fear is the better general debuff because frightened affects everything, but Enfeeble is the stronger choice against a single Strength-based monster, and it targets Fortitude rather than Will.")
s('Flourishing Flora', '200000', 'CDD', "Flourishing Flora is a 5-foot burst that lets Cyrus choose its damage type, with a minor effect on a critical failure. It only heightens by 1d4 per rank, so its damage falls behind other Expansive payloads.")
s('Gravitational Pull', '020030', 'BCC', "Gravitational Pull drags a creature 10 or 20 feet towards Cyrus unless it succeeds at a Fortitude save, or pulls up to five creatures with three actions. Pulling an enemy away from a caster and into Aspera's reach lets Cyrus Strike it without moving, and a critical failure leaves it prone. As a Spellstrike payload the pull is mostly wasted, because the target is already in reach.")
s('Kinetic Ram', '010020', 'CDD', "Kinetic Ram pushes one creature 10 or 20 feet away from Cyrus, or everything in a 5-foot emanation. It can push an enemy off a downed ally or out of a doorway, but pushing a target away from Cyrus usually takes it out of Aspera's reach, which works against how he fights.")
s('Mending', '000001', 'DDD', "Mending repairs a broken non-magical object. A repair kit and Crafting do the same job, and it only fixes magical items from rank 3.")
s('Mindlink', '000002', 'CDD', "Mindlink passes ten minutes of information to a willing creature instantly. It is useful for briefing an ally in the middle of a tense social scene, but Message covers most of the same needs for free.")
s('Mud Pit', '030000', 'CCD', "Mud Pit makes a 15-foot burst into difficult terrain for a minute, with no save. That slows enemies trying to reach the party's casters or escape Cyrus's reach. It takes three actions, so it is a pre-planned control spell rather than a payload.")
s('Noxious Vapors', '200100', 'CDD', "Noxious Vapors poisons creatures within 10 feet of Cyrus and conceals everyone in the cloud for a round. The concealment works against him as much as for him, because his own attacks into the cloud face the same flat check, and the damage is low.")
s('Penumbral Shroud', '001001', 'DDD', "Penumbral Shroud makes the target treat light as one step dimmer for ten minutes. It helps a light-sensitive ally more than it hinders an enemy.")
s('Pest Form', '000003', 'BAC', "Pest Form turns Cyrus into a tiny animal for ten minutes, and at rank 4 into a flying one. It is one of the best scouting spells he can cast, because a rat or bird goes unnoticed in places where invisibility would be detected. He can't make Strikes in the form, so it is strictly for exploration.")
s('Phantasmal Minion', '000002', 'DDD', "Phantasmal Minion creates a weak servant for simple tasks. It is too fragile to trigger traps reliably and has no use in combat.")
s('Shattering Gem', '000200', 'DDD', "Shattering Gem gives an ally a chance to have each Strike against it hit a gem first. It only works on a successful flat check and the gem has few Hit Points, so it prevents very little damage.")
s('Shockwave', '022000', 'BCD', "Shockwave knocks prone every terrestrial creature that fails its Reflex save in a 15-foot cone, and even a success leaves them off-guard until their next turn. Prone and off-guard enemies turn on Laughing Shadow's damage and give Mira and Cassius easier hits. Its area grows by 5 feet per rank. With Expansive Spellstrike the cone starts next to the target, which makes it one of the better group-control payloads at low ranks.")
s('Sleep', '040000', 'CBD', "Sleep is weak in combat at rank 1, because sleeping creatures wake on a successful Perception check. From rank 4 sleepers fall prone, drop their items and can't wake for the duration, which makes it a strong opener against groups of lower-level enemies. It has the incapacitation trait, so it fails against bosses. Its best use is ending a fight with guards without killing them.")
s('Snowball', '210000', 'CDD', "Snowball is an attack spell that slows the target for a round on a hit. Its damage rises by 2d4 per rank, well behind Shocking Grasp, so it is only worth it for the Speed penalty against a runner.")
s('Spider Sting', '102000', 'CDD', "Spider Sting afflicts the target with spider venom, which deals poison damage and enfeebles it for up to four rounds. The affliction doesn't heighten, so it falls behind quickly, and poison-immune enemies ignore it.")
s('Summon Animal', '100100', 'DDD', "Summon Animal creates an animal several levels below Cyrus, and he must Sustain it every turn. A summoned creature can flank with him, which makes the target off-guard for Laughing Shadow, but the action spent sustaining it is an action he can't spend on recharging Spellstrike. Summons suit full casters better than a magus.")
s('Tether', '030000', 'BCD', "Tether binds a creature to Cyrus. On a failed Reflex save it can't move more than 30 feet from him and takes a Speed penalty, and on a critical failure it is immobilised. That keeps a fleeing enemy or a skirmisher close, where moving through Aspera's reach can provoke Reactive Strike. It lasts a minute with no sustaining, and the tether can be attacked or Escaped.")
s('Thoughtful Gift', '000002', 'CCD', "Thoughtful Gift teleports a small item into an ally's hand. It can get a potion or scroll to an ally across the field for one action, but it needs Cyrus to have a free hand, which costs him his grip on Aspera.")
s('Ventriloquism', '000002', 'CCD', "Ventriloquism lets Cyrus throw his voice for ten minutes, or an hour at rank 2. It helps with diversions during infiltration, but Figment does a similar job as a cantrip.")
s('Wall of Shrubs', '020010', 'CCD', "Wall of Shrubs creates a 60-foot line of bushes that gives lesser cover, and at rank 3 standard cover and difficult terrain. It can block line of sight for an escape or protect the party's casters from archers, but Wall of Stone and Wall of Force do this far better when Cyrus has the slots.")

# ───────────── Rank 2 ─────────────
s('Animated Assault', '300000', 'CCD', "Animated Assault deals damage in a 10-foot burst and keeps dealing smaller damage each round it is sustained. Its burst works with Expansive Spellstrike, but the follow-up damage needs an action every turn, which Cyrus usually needs for recharging. Without sustaining it, the initial damage is too low for its rank.")
s('Ash Cloud', '210000', 'CCD', "Ash Cloud fills a 20-foot burst with smoke that burns creatures starting their turn inside it and hampers flyers. It takes three actions to cast and the damage is low, so it only makes sense to deny an area to a group of flying enemies.")
s('Charitable Urge', '040000', 'BCD', "Charitable Urge stuns the target for an action even on a successful Will save, and a failure forces it to spend its turn handing an item to the nearest creature. Stunned 1 on a success is unusually strong for a rank-2 spell. It is a single-target Will payload, so Spellstrike delivers it with a Strike. It has the incapacitation trait, so it only works against creatures of up to twice its rank in level, but heightening it raises that limit.")
s('Darkness', '020001', 'DDD', "Darkness blocks light in a 20-foot burst, and at rank 4 even darkvision only sees concealed targets through it. Cyrus has no darkvision, so it hinders him as much as his enemies, and it is mainly useful for covering an escape.")
s('Darkvision', '000004', 'BCB', "Darkvision fixes Cyrus's biggest sensory weakness: as a human he has neither darkvision nor low-light vision. The rank-2 version lasts an hour on himself, which makes a good wand for dungeon days, and from rank 5 it lasts until his next preparations and can be given to an ally.")
s('Deafness', '002000', 'DDD', "Deafness deafens a creature, which only hampers auditory actions and Perception. It rarely matters in combat and the target becomes immune for a minute.")
s('Entangling Flora', '040000', 'BBC', "Entangling Flora turns a 20-foot burst into difficult terrain for a minute, and creatures starting their turn inside must save or have their Speed reduced, with immobilisation on a critical failure. It needs no sustaining, so it holds a group of enemies back while Cyrus and the front line work on them. It has no initial save, so it can't be delivered with Spellstrike.")
s('Environmental Endurance', '000002', 'CCB', "Environmental Endurance protects a creature from severe heat or cold until the next preparations. A scroll or wand covers expeditions into deserts or mountains.")
s('Exploding Earth', '310000', 'CCD', "Exploding Earth is a bludgeoning attack payload with splash damage that hits adjacent creatures, including allies. Its damage heightens by 2d6 every two ranks, half the rate of Blazing Bolt, so it falls behind quickly.")
s('False Vitality', '000300', 'BCB', "False Vitality gives Cyrus temporary Hit Points for eight hours, so a morning casting covers the whole adventuring day. With one or two fights a day, that is extra Hit Points at the start of the first fight for a slot he would otherwise not use. A wand makes it a free daily buffer.")
s('Floating Flame', '300000', 'CCD', "Floating Flame deals fire damage in one square and can be moved each round by sustaining it. The sustain action competes with Cyrus's recharge, so it is only worth it when he has a spare action every turn.")
s('Heat Metal', '400000', 'BCD', "Heat Metal deals heavy fire damage plus persistent fire damage to a creature wearing or holding metal, or to a metal creature, and heightens by 2d6 and 1d4 per rank. Through Spellstrike it can target the struck enemy's armour, so the persistent damage stays with the creature. Against armoured soldiers and metal constructs it is one of the strongest Reflex payloads at its rank, but it does nothing to creatures without metal.")
s('Humanoid Form', '000004', 'CBC', "Humanoid Form physically changes Cyrus into another humanoid for ten minutes, which holds up better against close inspection than an illusion. From rank 3 he also gains the form's darkvision or low-light vision. It suits infiltration in a campaign with heavy social play.")
s('Illusory Creature', '210003', 'CCD', "Illusory Creature can flank, which makes the target off-guard for Laughing Shadow's damage. It also works as a decoy or a convincing guard outside combat. It must be sustained every turn and ends when hit, so in combat it costs the action Cyrus needs for recharging.")
s('Knock', '000004', 'BAB', "Knock gives a +4 bonus to open a lock or door and lets Cyrus attempt the Thievery check while casting, adding his level even if untrained. The party has no rogue, so this is the main way past locks without breaking them.")
s('Lucky Number', '000200', 'CCD', "Lucky Number sets a reaction that rerolls a check when the die shows a number chosen during the casting. It is cast during preparations, so the scroll works as well as a slot and needs no hands later. The chance of it triggering on an important roll is low, which is why Sure Strike was the preferred pick for Axuma's Awakening.")
s('Mist', '020002', 'CBD', "Mist conceals everything in a 20-foot burst for a minute. It is a good way to cover a retreat or protect the party from archers, but it also hampers the party's own attacks into the cloud, and it takes three actions.")
s('Oaken Resilience', '000100', 'DDD', "Oaken Resilience gives small resistances to bludgeoning and piercing in exchange for weakness to fire. The trade is poor for a slot.")
s('Phantasmal Treasure', '030000', 'CCD', "Phantasmal Treasure fascinates the target, for its own turn on a success and for a minute on a failure. Fascination ends if anyone acts against the target, so it is a way to take one enemy out of the fight while the party deals with others. Delivering it with Spellstrike defeats the purpose, because the party then has to leave that enemy alone, so it is a direct cast.")
s('Shrink', '000002', 'CCD', "Shrink makes a willing creature Tiny for five minutes. It helps with squeezing through small gaps or hiding during infiltration, but Cyrus loses Aspera's reach while shrunk.")
s('Splinter Volley', '400000', 'CCD', "Splinter Volley is an attack payload that heightens at the same rate as Blazing Bolt, with piercing damage and bleed on a critical hit. Cyrus only needs one heightened attack payload of this kind, and Blazing Bolt's fire is the more useful damage type.")
s('Sticky Fire', '202000', 'CCD', "Sticky Fire is an attack payload that leaves persistent fire and keeps the target enfeebled until the fire goes out. Its damage is low for its rank, so it is a minor debuff rather than a damage spell.")
s('Summon Elemental', '100100', 'DDD', "Summon Elemental has the same problem as other summons for Cyrus: sustaining it every turn takes an action he needs for Spellstrike. A summoned elemental can flank for Laughing Shadow, but the cost is high.")
s('Translate', '000003', 'CBB', "Translate lets a creature understand one language for an hour, and from rank 3 speak it. In a roleplay-heavy Forgotten Realms campaign the party will meet languages none of them know, so a scroll or wand is worth carrying.")
s('Vomit Swarm', '302000', 'BCD', "Vomit Swarm is a 30-foot cone that sickens creatures that fail their Reflex save, which lowers their AC and attacks. With Expansive Spellstrike the cone starts next to the target and can catch a group behind it. It is one of the better area payloads before Lightning Bolt and stays useful afterwards for its sickened rider.")
s('Water Walk', '000002', 'CCC', "Water Walk lets a creature walk on water for ten minutes, or ten creatures for an hour from rank 4. It is a situational scroll for river and coastal adventures.")
s('Web', '040000', 'BBC', "Web fills a 10-foot burst with webbing that slows or immobilises creatures each time they try to move, and at rank 4 the burst grows to 20 feet. It takes three actions and can be cut or burned away, but it holds a group in place long enough for the party to focus them.")
s('Marvelous Mount', '000002', 'DCC', "Marvelous Mount gives one creature a fast mount for eight hours, and from rank 5 a flying one. It is a travel spell that matters only when the party has no other transport.")
s('Blazing Armory', '000100', 'DDD', "Blazing Armory creates a weapon in a free hand. Cyrus fights with Aspera and the party's martial characters already have their own weapons.")

# ───────────── Rank 3 ─────────────
s('Agonizing Despair', '403000', 'ACD', "Agonizing Despair deals mental damage and leaves the target frightened even on a successful save, frightened 2 on a failure and frightened 3 on a critical failure. It heightens by 2d6 per rank. Through Spellstrike it combines a solid damage payload with Fear's debuff in one activity, which makes it one of Cyrus's best Will payloads. Mindless creatures and those immune to fear or mental effects ignore it.")
s('Aqueous Orb', '030000', 'CCD', "Aqueous Orb rolls a 10-foot ball of water that can engulf Large or smaller creatures, and it puts out fires. Keeping it moving takes an action every turn, which Cyrus usually needs for recharging, and an engulfed creature escapes with a DC 10 Athletics check.")
s('Clairaudience', '000003', 'CBC', "Clairaudience places an invisible ear up to 500 feet away for ten minutes, even through walls. It is a quiet way to overhear a meeting, and it suits the campaign's intrigue scenes.")
s('Cozy Cabin', '000002', 'DCC', "Cozy Cabin creates a shelter for a night's rest. It matters only on long wilderness journeys in bad weather.")
s('Crashing Wave', '400000', 'BCD', "Crashing Wave is a 30-foot cone of bludgeoning damage that heightens by 2d6 per rank, close to Fireball's damage, and bludgeoning is rarely resisted. With Expansive Spellstrike the cone starts next to the target and can be aimed away from Cyrus and his allies, which avoids Fireball's self-damage problem. Lightning Bolt still covers more of his needs because it also powers Sprinting Spellstrike.")
s('Curse of Lost Time', '004000', 'BCD', "Curse of Lost Time makes a living creature clumsy 1 and enfeebled 1, for a round on a success and an hour on a failure. Clumsy lowers AC and the Reflex DC his Trip targets, and enfeebled weakens the target's attacks. Against constructs it deals damage and stops repairs instead. It is a touch spell, so Spellstrike delivers it through Aspera's reach.")
s("Day's Weight", '004000', 'ACD', "Day's Weight makes a living creature fatigued and enfeebled 1, for a round on a success and a minute on a failure. Fatigued is a −1 penalty to AC and saves, so the whole party benefits. At rank 6 it can target ten creatures as a direct cast, which makes it a strong group debuff. It has 120-foot range and works as a Fortitude payload.")
s('Dive and Breach', '200040', 'BCD', "Dive and Breach moves Cyrus roughly 60 feet, including a teleport through any surface within 40 feet, and damages creatures next to where he leaves and where he arrives. It is a strong repositioning spell that leaves him one action to Strike, but the splashes also hit adjacent allies. Dimensional Assault does a similar job for a Focus Point.")
s('Dream Message', '000003', 'CBC', "Dream Message sends a one-minute message to someone anywhere on the same world the next time they sleep. It is a reliable way to contact allies and patrons across Faerûn, and a scroll is enough.")
s('Elemental Absorption', '000300', 'CCD', "Elemental Absorption gives resistance 5 against one element for a minute and lets Cyrus spend two actions to release the damage he prevented. It is a narrow pick for a fight against a known elemental foe, and the release costs actions he would rather spend on Spellstrike.")
s('Enthrall', '020002', 'CCD', "Enthrall fascinates a crowd while Cyrus speaks, which can buy time or create a diversion during an infiltration. It must be sustained and is easy to resist for anyone who disagrees with him.")
s('Gravity Well', '030040', 'BCD', "Gravity Well pulls every creature in a 30-foot burst towards its centre, up to 30 feet on a critical failure. That groups enemies for a follow-up area spell, such as an Expansive Spellstrike or Theldren's spells, or drags them away from the party's casters. Through Spellstrike it only moves the target, so it is a direct cast.")
s('Hypnotize', '040000', 'BCD', "Hypnotize creates a 10-foot cloud that dazzles everything inside it and fascinates creatures that fail a Will save, with no reactions on a critical failure. It shuts down a group of guards or weaker enemies, but keeping the cloud requires sustaining it each turn.")
s('Impending Doom', '234000', 'BCD', "Impending Doom builds up over three rounds. Even on a successful save the target becomes off-guard and then frightened 1; on a failure it is off-guard at once, frightened 2 next round and stunned the round after, then takes heavy mental damage. Off-guard turns on Laughing Shadow's damage. It has the incapacitation trait, so it is for enemies of Cyrus's level or lower.")
s('Levitate', '000002', 'CCC', "Levitate lifts a creature or object a few feet and lets Cyrus move it up and down slowly. It helps cross pits or reach a high window, but Fly and Gecko Grip do these jobs better.")
s('Locate', '000003', 'CBD', "Locate gives the direction to a specific object, or from rank 5 a specific creature. It is uncommon, so it needs access, and a scroll is enough for the occasional search for a stolen item or missing person.")
s('Mind Reading', '000003', 'CBD', "Mind Reading reads a creature's surface thoughts on a failed Will save. It is uncommon and the target may notice, but in the campaign's intrigue scenes it can expose a lie or a hidden plan.")
s('Organsight', '400000', 'BCD', "Organsight lets Cyrus make a Recall Knowledge check, using Medicine or an appropriate Lore, to add precision damage to his next slashing or piercing Strike or spell against the target, and he can repeat the check for one action each turn. Aspera deals slashing damage, so each successful check adds a large amount of damage to a Spellstrike. The cost is an action each turn, which competes with recharging, and creatures without organs or immune to precision damage ignore it.")
s('Phantom Prison', '040000', 'BCD', "Phantom Prison traps a creature inside illusory walls for a minute until it disbelieves. The target gets a new save each time it tries to escape or something outside affects it, so the party has to leave it alone for the spell to last. It has the incapacitation trait. At rank 8 it can target five creatures.")
s('Safe Passage', '000102', 'DCD', "Safe Passage protects creatures crossing a stretch of hazardous terrain. It is a niche scroll for a known collapsing bridge or lava field.")
s('Shared Invisibility', '000305', 'ABB', "Shared Invisibility makes Cyrus and up to five allies invisible for ten minutes as long as they stay within 30 feet of him. It is the best way to move the whole party past guards or into position for an ambush, and the party has no other source of group invisibility. Anyone who leaves the area or makes a hostile action ends it for themselves or everyone.")
s('Stinking Cloud', '043000', 'ABC', "Stinking Cloud conceals a 20-foot burst for a minute and sickens creatures that end their turn inside it, and slows them while they stay in it on a failed save. Slowed is one of the strongest conditions a group can suffer, and the cloud keeps working each round without sustaining. Creatures immune to poison ignore it.")
s('Tempest Cloak', '000300', 'CCD', "Tempest Cloak gives a creature a +2 bonus to AC against physical ranged attacks and surrounds it with difficult terrain. It protects a caster from archers and slows melee enemies approaching it. It is a modest defensive buff for its rank.")
s('Vampiric Feast', '400100', 'ACD', "Vampiric Feast deals heavy void damage with a basic Fortitude save and gives Cyrus temporary Hit Points equal to half the damage dealt. It heightens by 2d6 per rank. It is a touch spell, so Spellstrike delivers it through Aspera's reach, and it gives him a Fortitude payload with defensive value. It doesn't affect undead or constructs.")
s('Wall of Thorns', '040000', 'BCD', "Wall of Thorns creates a 60-foot wall that gives cover and damages anything moving through it. It splits a battlefield for a minute, but its sections have low Hit Points, so determined enemies can cut through.")
s('Wall of Water', '030000', 'CCD', "Wall of Water creates a 60-foot wall that creatures must swim through. It is weaker than Wall of Thorns as a barrier, but it puts out fires and is useful against fire-based enemies.")
s('Wall of Wind', '030000', 'BBD', "Wall of Wind stops arrows and other small ammunition and makes it hard to fly or move through. Against archers or a ranged ambush it protects the whole party for a minute.")
s('Warding Aggression', '000300', 'CDD', "Warding Aggression is a Strike that gives Cyrus a status bonus to AC against the target, maintained by hitting it every turn. It costs two actions for a single Strike and isn't a Spellstrike, so it fits poorly into his turns.")
s('Echo Jump', '200030', 'BCD', "Echo Jump teleports Cyrus 30 feet and deals force damage around the place he left. It gets him out of a surround while punishing the enemies around him, and the teleport doesn't trigger reactions. It is uncommon, and allies next to him are caught in the blast.")
s('Temporal Twin', '000300', 'CCD', "Temporal Twin lets an ally repeat a single action, usually a Strike, from a duplicate in a position Cyrus chooses. On Mira or Cassius it is effectively an extra Strike, but it costs Cyrus two actions and is uncommon.")
s('Blazing Dive', '200030', 'CCD', "Blazing Dive flies Cyrus up to 60 feet and damages everything within 10 feet of where he lands. It is a way to reach a group of enemies quickly, but it also hits allies near his landing point and leaves him one action.")
s('Oneiric Mire', '030000', 'BCD', "Oneiric Mire makes a 20-foot burst difficult terrain and slows or immobilises creatures that fail a Will save. It is a Will-based alternative to Entangling Flora for enemies with strong Reflex, but it takes three actions.")
s('Veil of Privacy', '000002', 'DCD', "Veil of Privacy protects one creature or object from detection and scrying for eight hours. It matters only if the party knows it is being watched by magic.")
s('Coral Scourge', '003000', 'CCD', "Coral Scourge makes the target clumsy, worsening each round on a failed Reflex save. It has the incapacitation trait, and the target can scrape the coral off with an action on a success.")

# ───────────── Rank 4 ─────────────
s('Bestial Curse', '003000', 'CCD', "Bestial Curse only affects humanoids. On a failed Fortitude save it leaves the target clumsy 1 for an hour and makes every manipulate action risk failure, which hampers enemy casters who rely on manipulate actions. A successful save only gives clumsy 1 for a round.")
s('Chromatic Ray', '400000', 'ACD', "Chromatic Ray is an attack spell that deals a fixed amount of damage based on a random colour, averaging around 36 at rank 4 and doubled on a critical hit. Through Spellstrike it uses Aspera's attack roll, so a hit is as likely as with his weapon, and that average beats most rank-4 payloads. At rank 6 the damage rises by 10 and half the results become effects instead, such as slowing the target for a minute with no save, which makes it a strong control payload too. The random damage type is its weakness against creatures with resistances.")
s('Countless Eyes', '000200', 'CCD', "Countless Eyes stops a creature from being flanked and improves its Seek results. It protects an ally who is being surrounded, but it doesn't affect AC or damage directly.")
s('Creation', '000003', 'CBC', "Creation makes a temporary object of wood or stone, and from rank 5 metal, that lasts an hour. It can provide a ladder, a barricade or a tool the party forgot. A scroll covers the occasional need.")
s('Dispelling Globe', '000400', 'CCD', "Dispelling Globe creates a 10-foot sphere that tries to counteract any spell entering it from outside for ten minutes. It protects the party against an enemy caster's area spells, but it is immobile, uncommon and counteracts at one rank lower than its own.")
s('Draw the Lightning', '300100', 'BCD', "Draw the Lightning deals electricity damage to a target that is taller than Cyrus or above him, then adds electricity damage to his first Strike each round for a minute. The bonus damage is small but lasts the whole fight. The target restriction excludes most Medium and smaller enemies on the ground, which limits when he can cast it.")
s('Dull Ambition', '002002', 'CCD', "Dull Ambition makes the target roll twice and take the lower result on initiative, and on a failure on checks for an hour or a day. It is mainly a tool for sabotaging a rival before a duel or contest, which suits the campaign's intrigue.")
s('Fire Shield', '000400', 'BCD', "Fire Shield gives Cyrus a shield he can raise without a hand, with Hardness 10 and 40 Hit Points, which absorbs far more than the Shield cantrip, and it burns creatures that hit him in melee. Raising it costs an action each turn and Shield Block uses his reaction, which competes with Reactive Strike.")
s('Flicker', '000300', 'CCD', "Flicker gives resistance to all damage except force for a minute, but teleports Cyrus 10 feet in a random direction at the end of each turn. The random teleport often moves him out of Aspera's reach or out of flanking, which undoes his positioning.")
s('Grasp of the Deep', '432000', 'ACD', "Grasp of the Deep deals bludgeoning damage with a Will save and leaves the target grabbed on a failure, using Cyrus's spell DC as the Escape DC. A grabbed creature is off-guard and immobilised, which turns on Laughing Shadow's damage for his next Strike and stops it from walking away. Through Spellstrike it combines damage and control in one activity. At rank 6 it can target five creatures as a direct cast.")
s('Ice Storm', '220000', 'CCD', "Ice Storm deals damage in a 20-foot burst and leaves difficult terrain for a minute, but it takes three actions, needs sustaining to keep the storm, and the initial damage is low for its rank.")
s('Invisibility Curtain', '010003', 'CCD', "Invisibility Curtain creates a wall that hides creatures on one side from those on the other. It can cover the party's approach or a retreat, but it must be sustained and ends when a hidden creature acts with hostility, until rank 7.")
s('Liminal Doorway', '000003', 'CCD', "Liminal Doorway creates a hidden extradimensional room for eight hours, which is a safe place to rest or hide. It is uncommon, so it needs access.")
s('Mercurial Stride', '200030', 'CCD', "Mercurial Stride lets Cyrus Stride twice and pass through one creature's space, poisoning it. It can get him past a blocker to a caster, but Dimensional Assault and Time Jump do the same job without a save or slot.")
s("Mirror's Misfortune", '000300', 'CCD', "Mirror's Misfortune creates an illusory double, and an enemy that attacks the double must roll its next attacks twice and take the lower result. It only works if enemies choose to attack the double, which intelligent enemies may avoid.")
s('Morass of Ages', '040000', 'BCD', "Morass of Ages surrounds Cyrus with an aura that grows by 5 feet each time he sustains it. Creatures in it make one Fortitude save: on a failure they are slowed 1 each turn they start inside it. Slowing every enemy next to him is very strong, but allies in the aura must also save, and sustaining it every turn costs the action he needs for recharging.")
s('Mountain Resilience', '000400', 'BBC', "Mountain Resilience gives a creature resistance 5 to physical damage, which becomes resistance 10 at rank 6. It lasts up to 20 minutes, losing a minute each time the creature is hit, so it can be cast before a fight. On Cyrus or Mira it prevents a large share of a melee monster's damage over a fight.")
s('Nightmare', '002001', 'DCD', "Nightmare torments a distant creature's sleep and leaves it fatigued. It is a tool for harassing a known enemy between sessions rather than a combat spell.")
s("Outcast's Curse", '002002', 'CCD', "Outcast's Curse makes the target roll twice and take the lower result on social checks, and makes others dislike it. It can sabotage a rival at court, but it has to be delivered by touch.")
s('Peaceful Bubble', '000003', 'CCD', "Peaceful Bubble protects a large camp from detection, scrying and dream spells for a day. It is uncommon and only matters when the party is being hunted by magic.")
s('Rust Cloud', '310000', 'BCD', "Rust Cloud fills a 20-foot burst with concealment and deals heavy slashing damage to every creature that starts its turn inside, every round for a minute, with no sustaining. Over a fight its damage adds up to more than most single area spells. The concealment cuts both ways, so it works best on enemies the party is holding at range or behind a wall.")
s('Seal Fate', '003000', 'CCD', "Seal Fate gives the target a weakness to a damage type Cyrus chooses, for a round on a success and a minute on a failure. Choosing slashing adds damage to every Aspera hit. The weakness is small, and the instant death only applies to enemies well below his level.")
s('Shape Stone', '000002', 'CCD', "Shape Stone reshapes a 10-foot cube of stone. It can open a passage, seal a door or create cover, which makes it a useful scroll for dungeons.")
s('Solid Fog', '030000', 'CCD', "Solid Fog conceals a 20-foot burst and makes it difficult terrain. It takes three actions and hampers the party as much as the enemy inside it.")
s('Spell Immunity', '000300', 'CCD', "Spell Immunity counteracts one named spell against a creature until the next preparations. It is excellent when the party knows exactly what an enemy caster uses, such as a known Dominate or Slow, and wasted otherwise.")
s('Suggestion', '020003', 'BBC', "Suggestion makes a creature follow a reasonable-sounding course of action. In a roleplay-heavy campaign it can end a confrontation or get past a guard without combat. It has the incapacitation trait, and the target knows it was targeted on a critical success.")
s('Telepathy', '000002', 'CCC', "Telepathy lets Cyrus speak mind-to-mind with creatures within 30 feet for ten minutes. Message already covers silent coordination, so this matters mainly for talking with creatures that can't speak.")
s('Vampiric Maiden', '320100', 'CCD', "Vampiric Maiden deals piercing and void damage with a Fortitude save, grants temporary Hit Points from the void damage and immobilises the target on a failure. Its damage is lower than Vampiric Feast at the same rank, and the immobilisation ends as soon as the target spends an action.")
s('Vapor Form', '000013', 'CCD', "Vapor Form turns a creature into a slow-flying cloud that can slip through cracks and resists physical damage. It is an infiltration or escape tool, and the creature can't attack or cast while in the form.")
s('Wall of Fire', '230000', 'BCD', "Wall of Fire creates a burning wall or ring that damages creatures crossing it and blocks sight. A ring around an enemy group forces them to take damage to reach the party. Fire resistance is common among the creatures most likely to ignore it.")
s('Weapon Storm', '200000', 'CCD', "Weapon Storm deals Aspera's damage die in a 30-foot cone or 10-foot emanation, and a critical failure applies the polearm critical specialisation effect. It doesn't use Aspera's runes, so its damage is low for its rank, and Crashing Wave is a better cone.")
s('Winning Streak', '000400', 'BBC', "Winning Streak quickens a creature for one action, for a Strike, Step or Stride, and the effect carries on as long as the party keeps landing critical hits. It costs only one action, so on Mira or Cassius it is an extra Strike for a cheap cast. On Cyrus it gives an extra Stride or Strike next turn, which helps him reach a target and still Spellstrike.")
s('Replicate', '000002', 'CCD', "Replicate creates an illusory double of a willing creature that can move and speak simply. It can stand in for a party member during an infiltration or alibi, but it must be sustained.")
s('Discern Lies', '000003', 'CBC', "Discern Lies gives a +4 bonus to Perception against lies for ten minutes. In interrogations and court scenes it is a strong edge, but it is uncommon.")
s('Planar Tether', '010001', 'CCD', "Planar Tether tries to counteract teleportation or planar travel affecting the target. It stops a fiend or caster from escaping by teleport, which is a narrow but sometimes decisive use.")

# ───────────── Rank 5 ─────────────
s('Acid Storm', '200000', 'CCD', "Acid Storm deals acid damage to creatures starting their turn in a 20-foot burst for a minute without sustaining. Its damage per round is well below Rust Cloud's at a lower rank, so it is only worth it against enemies resistant to slashing.")
s('Blink Charge', '300040', 'BCD', "Blink Charge teleports Cyrus next to a creature up to 60 feet away and makes a Strike with Aspera that adds force damage. It does the job of Dimensional Assault without a Focus Point, and the teleport doesn't trigger reactions. It is not a Spellstrike, so it doesn't use the spell slot's damage as well as a payload would, but it is an efficient way to reach a back-line enemy and still hit it.")
s('Blister', '400000', 'BCD', "Blister grows one to four blisters on a creature depending on its Fortitude save, and Cyrus can pop each one for a single action to deal acid damage in a 15-foot cone from the target. Every pop is a full damage spell for one action, and even a successful save gives one blister. Popping competes with his recharge action, but on turns when Spellstrike is spent, popping a blister is a strong use of the third action.")
s('Cloak of Colors', '020400', 'BBC', "Cloak of Colors dazzles enemies next to the target, and creatures that hit it in melee are blinded or stunned on a failed Will save. Cast on Mira or Cassius, it punishes every enemy that attacks them. The blinding has the incapacitation trait, so bosses are rarely affected.")
s('Elemental Breath', '400000', 'BCD', "Elemental Breath is a 60-foot cone with heavy damage and a rider that depends on the element. With two actions the element is random, which makes resistances a risk, and with three Cyrus chooses but can't Spellstrike. As an Expansive Spellstrike payload it covers a large area away from the party.")
s('Flowing Strike', '200040', 'CCD', "Flowing Strike moves Cyrus 50 feet without triggering reactions and lets him Strike during the move, adding damage and a push on a hit. It costs three actions for one Strike, which is worse than Sprinting Spellstrike once he has it.")
s('Forceful Hand', '000300', 'CCD', "Forceful Hand creates a floating hand that shields Cyrus or an ally, and at rank 6 it can shove enemies. It must be sustained each turn, which competes with recharging.")
s('Freezing Rain', '330000', 'CCD', "Freezing Rain makes a 20-foot burst difficult terrain and, from the next round, can freeze to damage and slow creatures inside. It takes three actions and must be sustained, so it costs Cyrus too many actions over a fight.")
s('Geyser', '320000', 'BCD', "Geyser deals bludgeoning and fire damage in a 10-foot radius up to 500 feet away and throws creatures into the air, so they take falling damage and land prone. Prone enemies are off-guard for Laughing Shadow's damage. Its area is a cylinder rather than a burst, so it can't be delivered with Expansive Spellstrike.")
s('Glimmer of Charm', '000003', 'CCD', "Glimmer of Charm improves the attitude of creatures who end their turn near Cyrus. It can calm a tense negotiation, but it has the incapacitation trait and must be sustained.")
s('Grisly Growths', '400000', 'ACD', "Grisly Growths deals heavy piercing damage with a basic Fortitude save and heightens by 2d6 per rank. Through Spellstrike it is one of the strongest single-target Fortitude payloads, and unlike Vampiric Feast it works on undead and constructs with limbs. Oozes and creatures without limbs are immune.")
s('Hallucination', '010004', 'BBC', "Hallucination makes a creature perceive one thing as another, miss something that is there, or see something that isn't, for an hour. In intrigue it can hide the party, disguise a building or make a guard ignore a specific person. It has the incapacitation trait.")
s('Illusory Scene', '000003', 'CBC', "Illusory Scene creates a convincing scene of up to ten creatures or objects for an hour. It can fake a camp, a crowd or a guard post during an infiltration.")
s('Imaginary Lockbox', '000002', 'CCC', "Imaginary Lockbox stores a container in Cyrus's mind until his next preparations. It can smuggle items past a search, but retrieving them takes three actions.")
s('Invoke Spirits', '210000', 'CCD', "Invoke Spirits deals mental and void damage in a 10-foot burst and frightens creatures that critically fail. The damage is low unless it is sustained each turn, which competes with recharging.")
s("Mariner's Curse", '004000', 'BCD', "Mariner's Curse makes the target sickened 1, and on a failed Will save it can't reduce the condition below 1 until the curse is removed. That is a −1 penalty to AC, attacks and saves for the rest of the fight, which outlasts frightened. It is a touch spell, so Spellstrike delivers it through Aspera's reach.")
s('Mind Probe', '000004', 'CBD', "Mind Probe lets Cyrus question a creature's memories, with each answer resisted by a Deception check. It is uncommon, but in a campaign of plots and secrets it can extract information no interrogation would.")
s('Mirror Malefactors', '403000', 'ACD', "Mirror Malefactors deals heavy mental damage with a basic Will save and keeps the target frightened 1 while the mirrors last. Each time Cyrus sustains it the damage repeats, which makes the sustain action worth as much as a damage spell. Through Spellstrike the first hit comes with his Strike, and on later turns he can choose between sustaining it and recharging. The spell ends if the target critically succeeds on any save, and creatures without reflections are immune.")
s('Pressure Zone', '004000', 'BCD', "Pressure Zone makes living creatures in a 20-foot burst deafened and clumsy 1 on a success or clumsy 2 on a failure. Clumsy 2 lowers AC and Reflex for the whole group, which helps every attacker in the party and Cyrus's Trip. It takes three actions, but it reaches 500 feet.")
s('Quicken Time', '000340', 'CCD', "Quicken Time quickens every creature starting its turn in a 20-foot burst, for a Stride or Strike. It affects enemies as well as allies, and everything inside is concealed from outside, so it only helps when the party alone is in the area.")
s('Rewinding Step', '000020', 'CCD', "Rewinding Step marks a location and lets Cyrus return to it instantly within ten minutes. It is a prepared escape route for a risky infiltration.")
s('Slither', '040000', 'BCD', "Slither fills a 20-foot burst with shadow snakes that grab or restrain creatures each round for a minute. Grabbed creatures are off-guard, which turns on Laughing Shadow's damage. It takes three actions, but needs no sustaining.")
s('Stagnate Time', '050000', 'ABC', "Stagnate Time makes every creature that starts its turn in a 20-foot burst attempt a Will save or be slowed 1, or slowed 2 on a critical failure, for a minute without sustaining. Over a fight it removes many enemy actions. It affects allies in the area too, so it should be placed where the enemy is and the party isn't.")
s('Subconscious Suggestion', '010003', 'BBC', "Subconscious Suggestion plants a suggestion that the target follows when a trigger occurs. It suits long-term intrigue, such as making a guard open a door at midnight, and it has the incapacitation trait.")
s('Summon Dragon', '200100', 'DDD', "Summon Dragon has the same problem as other summons for Cyrus: sustaining it every turn takes an action he needs for Spellstrike.")
s('Telekinetic Haul', '000002', 'DCD', "Telekinetic Haul moves a heavy object at range. It solves the occasional engineering problem, such as lifting a portcullis.")
s('Toxic Cloud', '300000', 'BCD', "Toxic Cloud is a 20-foot burst of poison fog that drifts away from Cyrus each round and damages breathing creatures that start their turn inside. It deals a lot of damage over a minute without sustaining, but it takes three actions, and undead and constructs are immune.")
s('Truespeech', '000004', 'BBC', "Truespeech lets a creature understand and speak any language for an hour. It is uncommon, but in a campaign with diplomacy across many peoples it removes language barriers entirely.")
s('Umbral Journey', '000003', 'CBC', "Umbral Journey lets the party travel three days' distance in an hour through the Netherworld. It is uncommon and only matters when the campaign involves long journeys.")
s('Wall of Ice', '030000', 'BCD', "Wall of Ice creates an opaque wall or dome that blocks sight and movement, and chills anyone who passes through a broken section. A dome can trap or protect a group.")
s('Wave of Despair', '050000', 'ACD', "Wave of Despair is a 30-foot cone in which every creature that fails its Will save loses its reactions and must save again each turn or be slowed 1, for a minute. Even a success removes reactions for a round. With Expansive Spellstrike the cone starts next to the target, which makes it one of Cyrus's best group control payloads, and at rank 7 the cone becomes 60 feet.")
s('Etheric Shards', '120000', 'CCD', "Etheric Shards makes a 20-foot burst difficult terrain even for flyers and damages creatures moving through it. It slows enemies approaching the party, but the damage is minor.")
s('Telepathic Bond', '000003', 'CBC', "Telepathic Bond lets Cyrus and four allies communicate telepathically anywhere on the same world for eight hours. It is uncommon, but it suits split-party infiltrations.")
s("King's Castle", '000030', 'CCD', "King's Castle swaps Cyrus with a willing ally up to 60 feet away. It can pull a wounded caster out of danger by putting him in their place, but it is uncommon and costs two actions.")
s('Control Water', '000002', 'DCD', "Control Water raises or lowers water across a large area. It is a niche scroll for flooded dungeons or naval scenarios.")

# ───────────── Rank 6 ─────────────
s('Arrow Salvo', '500000', 'BCD', "Arrow Salvo deals heavy piercing damage in a 30-foot burst up to 100 feet away and knocks creatures prone on a critical failure. As a direct cast it is one of the strongest area damage spells at its rank. Its burst is too large for Expansive Spellstrike from 10 feet without hitting Cyrus, so it competes with his other rank-6 choices as a turn spent casting rather than striking.")
s('Chromatic Image', '000400', 'BCD', "Chromatic Image works like Mirror Image, with three images that absorb attacks, and each image punishes the creature that destroys it with damage or a condition. Against a monster with several attacks per turn it prevents a lot of damage.")
s('Cursed Metamorphosis', '040000', 'BCD', "Cursed Metamorphosis turns a creature into a harmless animal for a minute on a failed Fortitude save, and sickens it even on a success. It has the incapacitation trait, so it is for enemies of Cyrus's level or lower, where it removes one from the fight.")
s('Dominate', '050000', 'BCD', "Dominate stuns the target on a successful save and controls it on a failure, with a new save each turn. Turning an enemy against its allies is very strong, but it is uncommon and has the incapacitation trait, so it only works on enemies of Cyrus's level or lower.")
s('Field of Razors', '120000', 'CCD', "Field of Razors makes a 20-foot burst difficult terrain that damages anything moving through it. It takes three actions and only punishes enemies that choose to move.")
s('Flame Vortex', '200000', 'CCD', "Flame Vortex creates a moving column of fire that must be sustained to move. Its damage is low for its rank and sustaining competes with recharging.")
s('Frost Pillar', '040000', 'BCD', "Frost Pillar restrains a creature inside a pillar of ice on a failed Reflex save. Restrained creatures are off-guard and can barely act, which sets up Laughing Shadow's damage. It must be sustained, and the ice can be broken, especially with fire.")
s('Lignify', '050000', 'ACD', "Lignify slows a creature even on a successful Fortitude save, and on a failure keeps it slowed with a chance each turn of turning it to wood. Slowed on a success makes it reliable against bosses, and its ongoing petrification only has the incapacitation trait on the later saves. It has 120-foot range and works as a Fortitude payload, which complements Slow's Fortitude-free control.")
s('Necrotize', '502000', 'ACD', "Necrotize deals very heavy void damage with a Fortitude save and adds a random debilitation that lasts longer on a failure. It heightens by 2d6 per rank. Through Spellstrike it is one of Cyrus's strongest single-target payloads at rank 6, alongside Disintegrate, and it targets Fortitude rather than AC. It doesn't affect undead or constructs.")
s('Never Mind', '003000', 'BCD', "Never Mind leaves a creature stupefied 4 indefinitely on a failed Will save, which cripples a spellcaster. A success only gives stupefied 2 for a round, and it has the incapacitation trait.")
s('Phantasmal Calamity', '510000', 'ACD', "Phantasmal Calamity deals heavy mental damage in a 30-foot burst up to 500 feet away with a basic Will save, and can stun creatures that critically fail. As a direct cast it is one of the strongest area damage spells at rank 6, and it targets Will, which many monsters neglect. Mindless creatures are immune, and the burst is too large for Expansive Spellstrike from reach.")
s("Poltergeist's Fury", '200000', 'CCD', "Poltergeist's Fury damages everything within 20 feet of Cyrus and grows each time he sustains it. It takes three actions, damages allies near him, and sustaining it competes with recharging.")
s('Purple Worm Sting', '300000', 'CCD', "Purple Worm Sting afflicts a creature with purple worm venom, which deals heavy poison damage over several rounds and enfeebles. Creatures immune to poison ignore it, which includes many high-level undead, constructs and fiends.")
s('Repulsion', '030000', 'DCD', "Repulsion stops creatures from approaching Cyrus in an aura up to 40 feet. He fights by keeping enemies within Aspera's reach, so pushing them away works against him.")
s('Spellwrack', '002000', 'CCD', "Spellwrack makes every spell with a duration on the target deal force damage and wear off faster. It punishes enemies relying on buffs, but most monsters have few.")
s('Tangling Creepers', '030000', 'CCD', "Tangling Creepers slows every creature in a 40-foot burst for ten minutes and can lash out with vines each round when sustained. It is better for holding a large area than for a single fight.")
s('Vampiric Exsanguination', '500100', 'ACD', "Vampiric Exsanguination is a 30-foot cone of heavy void damage with a basic Fortitude save, and Cyrus gains temporary Hit Points from the creature that took the most. With Expansive Spellstrike the cone starts next to the target and can catch a group behind it. It only affects living creatures.")
s('Vibrant Pattern', '040000', 'BCD', "Vibrant Pattern dazzles creatures inside a 10-foot burst and blinds those that fail a Will save. It must be sustained and has the incapacitation trait, so it suits groups of lower-level enemies.")
s('Vitrifying Blast', '440000', 'ACD', "Vitrifying Blast is a 15-foot cone of piercing damage that slows creatures that fail their Reflex save and makes them weak to sonic and bludgeoning damage. With Expansive Spellstrike the cone starts next to the target, and slowing a group in the same activity as a Strike is very strong.")
s('Wall of Metal', '030000', 'CCD', "Wall of Metal creates a tall metal wall, which at higher ranks can be silver or cold iron. Wall of Force does the barrier job better unless the party needs a specific metal.")
s('Zero Gravity', '030000', 'CCD', "Zero Gravity removes gravity in a cylinder, leaving creatures adrift unless they push off surfaces. It is uncommon and must be sustained.")
s('Awaken Entropy', '300000', 'CCD', "Awaken Entropy damages creatures that enter or start their turn in a 10-foot burst, but it takes three actions and must be sustained.")
s('Explosive Barrage', '500000', 'BCD', "Explosive Barrage creates a 20-foot burst plus several smaller bursts of fire and sonic damage with a basic Fortitude save. It deals heavy damage across a wide, irregular area as a direct cast, and splitting the damage between fire and sonic limits the effect of resistances.")
s('Frozen Fog', '403000', 'BCD', "Frozen Fog conceals a 20-foot burst for a minute and deals cold damage to creatures that start their turn in it, making those that fail clumsy and slower. It needs no sustaining to keep working, but the concealment also hampers the party.")
s('Phantom Orchestra', '200000', 'CCD', "Phantom Orchestra deals sonic damage each time it is sustained. Its damage depends on spending an action every turn, which competes with recharging.")
s('Scrying', '000004', 'CBD', "Scrying lets Cyrus watch a creature anywhere on the same plane. It is uncommon, but it is the classic way to find a villain or check on a captive.")

# ───────────── Rank 7 ─────────────
s('Duplicate Foe', '210000', 'CCD', "Duplicate Foe creates a weaker copy of an enemy that fights for the party. It takes three actions and must be sustained, which costs Cyrus most of his turns.")
s('Energy Aegis', '000400', 'ABB', "Energy Aegis gives a creature resistance 5 to eight energy types until the next preparations. Cast in the morning on Cyrus or Mira, it blunts every elemental attack of the day for no actions in combat. A wand makes it a free daily buff.")
s('Fiery Body', '200100', 'CCD', "Fiery Body makes Cyrus immune to fire and adds damage to his fire spells. Aspera has reach, so the aura that burns attackers rarely matters, and the weakness to cold is a real cost.")
s('Heaving Earth', '030020', 'CCD', "Heaving Earth sends a shockwave along the ground that pushes creatures in the line and damages the final target. It needs a continuous ground surface and is less reliable than other control spells at this rank.")
s('Hungry Depths', '300000', 'CCD', "Hungry Depths creates a damaging vortex that grows each time it is sustained. It takes three actions and sustaining competes with recharging.")
s('Interplanar Teleport', '000004', 'CBD', "Interplanar Teleport carries the party to another plane. It is uncommon and needs a planar key, and it only matters if the campaign travels beyond the Material Plane.")
s('Lifewood Cage', '040000', 'BCD', "Lifewood Cage traps every creature in a 20-foot cube that fails a Reflex save, and the bars give cover against most weapons. It removes a group from the fight while the party deals with others, but it must be sustained.")
s('Mask of Terror', '000400', 'BCD', "Mask of Terror makes any creature that tries to harm the target save or become frightened 2, and lose the action on a critical failure. On Mira, Cassius or Cyrus it frightens most attackers once per round each. At rank 8 it covers five creatures.")
s('Momentary Recovery', '000030', 'CCD', "Momentary Recovery teleports Cyrus 60 feet and lets him take actions on himself before he reappears, but leaves him slowed afterwards. It is an escape tool, and Dimensional Disappearance does this job without a slot.")
s('Planar Palace', '000003', 'CBC', "Planar Palace creates a secure demiplane dwelling until the next preparations. It is uncommon, but it guarantees a safe rest in hostile territory.")
s('Planar Seal', '000002', 'CCD', "Planar Seal blocks teleportation and summoning in a large area until the next preparations. It is uncommon and only matters against enemies who rely on teleporting or summoning.")
s('Power Word Blind', '045000', 'ACD', "Power Word Blind blinds a creature for one action with no save, permanently if its level is low enough and for minutes against enemies a little above Cyrus's level. Only much stronger enemies are merely dazzled. One action and no save leaves room for a Spellstrike on the same turn. It is uncommon.")
s('Prismatic Armor', '000400', 'BCD', "Prismatic Armor gives a creature resistance 5 to seven damage types for a minute and dazzles creatures that attack it. On a front-liner it prevents a large share of mixed elemental damage.")
s('Prismatic Spray', '430000', 'BCD', "Prismatic Spray hits a 30-foot cone with random beams that deal heavy damage or impose petrification, confusion or slow. Each creature rolls separately, so the results are unpredictable, but on average it is strong in both damage and control.")
s('Project Image', '000002', 'DCD', "Project Image lets Cyrus cast spells from an illusory double. His spells are mostly delivered through Aspera, so this rarely helps him.")
s('Reverse Gravity', '050000', 'BCD', "Reverse Gravity drops every unsecured creature in a large cylinder upwards for a minute, dealing falling damage and leaving them stuck on the ceiling or floating. Creatures that can't fly are removed from the fight. It is uncommon.")
s('Retrocognition', '000003', 'CBD', "Retrocognition reveals impressions of past events at Cyrus's location. It is a strong investigation tool for a crime scene or ruin.")
s('Shadow Raid', '400000', 'BCD', "Shadow Raid deals damage only to enemies in a 30-foot burst, lets Cyrus choose the damage type, and keeps damaging enemies that end their turns inside. Because it spares allies, it can be dropped on a melee. It takes three actions.")
s('Time Beacon', '000503', 'ADD', "Time Beacon costs one action at the start of Cyrus's turn and lets him rewind the rest of the turn if it goes badly. Followed by a high-rank Spellstrike, it means a missed Strike, a poor damage roll or a successful enemy save can be undone, and the rewind restores the spell slot because the casting is undone too. It fits Aspera's time theme and suits the stave, where it needs no hands. As a scroll or wand it is poor, because the casting needs an action and a free hand on his own turn.")
s('Vacuum', '030000', 'DCD', "Vacuum steals the breath of creatures around Cyrus. It has the incapacitation trait, must be sustained and affects allies next to him.")
s('Warp Mind', '040000', 'BCD', "Warp Mind confuses a creature for a minute on a failed Will save, or permanently on a critical failure. It has the incapacitation trait, so it suits enemies of Cyrus's level or lower.")
s('Incarnate Tempest of Shades', '014000', 'BCD', "Incarnate Tempest of Shades is a three-action incarnate spell with no damage. When it arrives, every enemy within 60 feet attempts a Fortitude save or becomes drained 1 to 3; when it departs at the end of Cyrus's next turn, every enemy within 100 feet attempts a Will save and is frightened 1 on a success, frightened 3 on a failure, and also fleeing on a critical failure. Frightened 3 across a whole enemy group is one of the strongest party-wide debuffs at this rank, and the drained condition lowers their Fortitude saves for the rest of the day. The cost is a full turn without a Spellstrike and a one-round delay before the fear lands, so it is best opened with against a large group, before Cyrus closes in.")

# ───────────── Rank 8 ─────────────
s('Boil Blood', '502000', 'ACD', "Boil Blood deals very heavy fire damage with a Fortitude save and leaves the target drained 2 on a failure. Through Spellstrike it is one of the strongest single-target payloads for a rank-8 slot. Creatures without blood are immune.")
s('Confusing Colors', '040000', 'BCD', "Confusing Colors dazzles everything around a 20-foot cloud and confuses or stuns creatures that fail a Will save. It has the incapacitation trait and must be sustained.")
s('Dream Council', '000002', 'DCD', "Dream Council lets up to twelve creatures meet in a shared dream. Telepathic Bond and Dream Message cover most of the same needs.")
s('Earthquake', '040000', 'CCD', "Earthquake shakes a 60-foot burst, imposing penalties and opening fissures. Its huge area makes it hard to use without catching the party.")
s('Hidden Mind', '000303', 'CBC', "Hidden Mind gives a creature a +4 bonus to saves against mental effects and blocks detection until the next preparations. It is uncommon and strongest against a known mind-controlling enemy.")
s('Pinpoint', '000004', 'CBD', "Pinpoint reveals the exact location of a creature or object. It is uncommon, but it ends any search.")
s('Power Word Stun', '060000', 'ACD', "Power Word Stun stuns a creature for one action with no save. Against weaker enemies it stuns for several rounds, and even against much stronger ones it still removes an action. That makes it one of the few ways to reliably take actions from a boss, while leaving Cyrus two actions to Spellstrike. It is uncommon.")
s('Prismatic Wall', '040000', 'BCD', "Prismatic Wall creates a wall of seven layers, each with a different effect on anything passing through. It blocks almost anything for an hour.")
s('Rainbow Fumarole', '300000', 'CCD', "Rainbow Fumarole creates a column with random damage and effects. It takes three actions and is less reliable than Prismatic Spray.")
s('Unrelenting Observation', '000002', 'DCD', "Unrelenting Observation lets several creatures track one subject precisely. It is a niche investigation spell.")
s('Whirlpool', '030000', 'CCD', "Whirlpool creates a large damaging vortex that must be sustained. It is mainly useful near water.")
s('Sudden Transposition', '400040', 'BCD', "Sudden Transposition teleports two creatures within 60 feet of Cyrus to spaces he chooses and deals heavy damage on a failed Fortitude save. It can drag enemies into his reach or away from a caster. It is uncommon.")
s('Incarnate Archmage', '101100', 'DDD', "Incarnate Archmage deals 3d4+3 force damage to up to five creatures when it arrives, stops beneficial spells on allies near it from counting down while it is present, and when it departs at the end of Cyrus's next turn makes enemies within 100 feet attempt a Will save or be stupefied 2 for a round and possibly lose one lower-rank spell. Each effect is small for a rank-8 spell, and it costs three actions and a turn without a Spellstrike.")

# ───────────── Rank 9 ─────────────
s('Bilocation', '000350', 'ABD', "Bilocation gives Cyrus a second body for ten minutes, and he can act from either one. That doubles the area he threatens with Reactive Strike and lets him Spellstrike from whichever body is in a better position. Effects on one affect both, so it isn't extra Hit Points.")
s('Detonate Magic', '200002', 'CCD', "Detonate Magic counteracts a spell or magic item and turns it into a force explosion. It is uncommon and depends on a counteract check.")
s('Magnetic Dominion', '000040', 'CCD', "Magnetic Dominion relocates every metal-armoured creature or metal object within 100 feet. Against an army of armoured soldiers it can rearrange the battlefield, but it is narrow.")
s('Power Word Kill', '500000', 'ACD', "Power Word Kill kills a weaker creature outright with one action and no save, and deals 50 damage to stronger ones. Against bosses that is a large chunk of damage for one action, leaving two for Spellstrike. It is uncommon.")
s('Prismatic Sphere', '040000', 'CCD', "Prismatic Sphere surrounds a small area with seven protective layers. It is a strong defence for a held position, but it locks the party in place.")
s('Resplendent Mansion', '000003', 'CCC', "Resplendent Mansion creates a grand mansion until the next preparations. It can host a party or impress a court, which suits the campaign's social side.")
s('Telepathic Demand', '010002', 'CCD', "Telepathic Demand sends a suggestion to a creature Cyrus has contacted telepathically before, anywhere on the same plane. It has the incapacitation trait.")
s('Unspeakable Shadow', '035000', 'ACD', "Unspeakable Shadow leaves the target frightened 2 even on a successful Will save, and forces it to spend an action each turn fighting or fleeing its shadow. On a failure it is frightened 3 and can't drop below frightened 1 for a minute. Through Spellstrike it is a strong Will payload for a rank-9 slot.")
s('Incarnate Draconic Legion', '400000', 'CCD', "Incarnate Draconic Legion breathes a 120-foot line and a 60-foot cone that cannot overlap, each dealing 10d8 damage with a basic Reflex save, and an arcane caster chooses force or mental for each. When it departs at the end of Cyrus's next turn it deals 9d8 slashing to every enemy within 20 feet of it. The two breath areas cover a large part of a battlefield, but the damage is modest for a rank-9 slot, it costs three actions, and both areas hit allies, so it is a choice for an open field against many enemies rather than a regular pick.")

# ───────────── later additions ─────────────
s('Glass Sand', '400000', 'CCD', "Glass Sand is a 60-foot cone of slashing damage that heightens by 2d6 per rank and adds bleed on a failure. With Expansive Spellstrike its long cone can catch a whole group behind the target. It is uncommon, and Crashing Wave covers the same role without access.")
s('Magical Fetters', '034000', 'BCD', "Magical Fetters makes a creature clumsy 3 with a Speed penalty for a minute on a failed Reflex save, and also slowed on a critical failure. Clumsy 3 is a large penalty to AC and Reflex. It is uncommon and has the incapacitation trait, so it only works fully on enemies of Cyrus's level or lower.")
s('Radiant Globe', '020300', 'CCD', "Radiant Globe destroys arrows and bolts passing through a 10-foot dome and dazzles archers shooting through it. It protects a group from ranged attackers, but it must be sustained and is uncommon.")
s('Sanguine Mist', '300100', 'CCD', "Sanguine Mist deals void damage in a 10-foot burst and conceals it, with more damage and temporary Hit Points each time Cyrus sustains it. Sustaining competes with recharging, and it only harms living creatures.")
s('Blinding Bottle', '044000', 'BCD', "Blinding Bottle exposes a 30-foot burst to a blinding poison, so creatures that fail their Fortitude save are blinded for rounds at a time. The poison has the incapacitation trait, and creatures immune to poison ignore it. Against a group of lower-level enemies it can shut down a whole fight.")
s('Blinding Foam', '305000', 'BCD', "Blinding Foam is an attack spell that deals acid damage and blinds the target for a minute, until it spends three actions clearing the foam. Through Spellstrike, a hit with Aspera blinds the target with no save, which forces flat checks on every attack it makes. It has the incapacitation trait, so it is weaker against higher-level enemies, and it is uncommon.")
s('Utter Destruction', '400000', 'CCD', "Utter Destruction is a 30-foot cone of sonic and void damage with a Fortitude save that also deafens. With Expansive Spellstrike the cone starts next to the target. Vampiric Exsanguination deals more damage at the same rank, and Utter Destruction is uncommon.")

# high-rank reactions: worth a B, with the slot cost noted
_HIGH_OLD = (" At this rank it also costs a slot that could hold a spell he casts on his own turn, which makes it harder to"
             " justify than the lower-rank reactions.")
_HIGH_NEW = (" Having one strong reaction prepared besides Reactive Strike is valuable, but at this rank it takes a slot that"
             " could hold a spell he casts on his own turn, which is a real cost.")
for _n in ('Unexpected Transposition', 'Spell Riposte'):
    _r, _g, _e = E[_n]
    E[_n] = (_r, 'BDD', _e.replace(_HIGH_OLD, _HIGH_NEW))

s('Roar of Freedom', '503400', 'SCD', "Roar of Freedom does more for one action than almost any other spell. It deals heavy sonic damage to every enemy within 30 feet, leaves those that fail their Will save frightened and stupefied, and gives every ally in the area temporary Hit Points, all without harming the party. One action means it fits after a Spellstrike on any turn, and it has no attack roll, so the multiple attack penalty doesn't matter. Most full casters would be glad to have it at two actions. Its limits are that it uses Cyrus's spell DC, so many enemies will succeed and only take half damage, it only reaches enemies near him, and it can't be delivered through Spellstrike because Expansive Spellstrike doesn't cover emanations.")

# occult healing and recovery, for items after the Witch dedication
s('Gentle Breeze', '000400', 'FCA', "Gentle Breeze heals every living creature in a 40-foot burst that stays inside for ten minutes, by 10 Hit Points plus 10 more every two ranks, and helps saves against afflictions. It is out-of-combat healing for the whole party at once, which spares Yara's slots after a fight. As an occult spell Cyrus can't learn it, but a wand gives that party-wide rest every day with no action cost that matters.")
s('Sound Body', '000303', 'FAB', "Sound Body counteracts blinded, dazzled, deafened, enfeebled or sickened, and from rank 4 drained and slowed, on a willing creature. Removing slowed from Mira or Cassius in a hard fight is worth the actions it costs. Yara can remove some of these conditions, but not all, so a scroll is a strong backup.")
s('Shock to the System', '000503', 'FSA', "Shock to the System brings back a creature that died in the last round, heals it heavily and quickens it for a minute, or does the same healing and quickening for a living ally. Reviving a fallen ally in the round they die is worth any action cost, which makes this one of the few combat spells worth holding in a scroll. It is occult, so a scroll or wand is the only way Cyrus can cast it.")

s('Wall of Mirrors', '050003', 'SBC', "Wall of Mirrors raises a solid glass wall up to 50 feet long and 20 feet high for two actions. It lasts a minute and can be dismissed early. Because it is solid, it blocks movement, physical projectiles and line of effect, so it can cut an enemy group in half, shut a corridor or shield the party's casters from archers and most spells. Creatures on each side see the other side only as concealed shapes. Each section has 40 Hit Points and Hardness 10 at rank 4, rising with rank, and every creature that Strikes it takes mental damage, so breaking through costs enemies both actions and Hit Points. A solid wall for two actions at rank 4 is cheaper than Wall of Stone's three actions at rank 5, which leaves Cyrus an action to Stride or recharge on the same turn. It is rare, so outside Aspera's stave it needs access, and from a scroll it is still a strong answer to an encounter that needs splitting.")

# strong spells from adventure and Lost Omens books, given cards once rarity stopped mattering
s("Mantis's Grasp", '430000', 'ACD', "Mantis's Grasp deals force damage with a Reflex save and immobilises the target for a round on a failure, or for a minute on a critical failure. Force is almost never resisted, and immobilising a skirmisher keeps it inside Aspera's reach. Through Spellstrike it is one of the best Reflex payloads at rank 4, and at rank 7 it can target five creatures as a direct cast.")
s('Entangle Fate', '004000', 'ACD', "Entangle Fate makes up to four creatures off-guard even on a successful Will save, until the start of their next turn, and for three rounds on a failure, with stupefied and further conditions if several fail. Off-guard lowers their AC for every attack the party makes and turns on Laughing Shadow's damage. Through Spellstrike only the struck target is affected, so the stronger use is a direct cast on a group before Cyrus and the front line attack.")
s('Missed Cue', '545000', 'SCD', "Missed Cue deals heavy mental damage with a Will save and frightens the target even on a success. On a failure it is frightened 2 and slowed 1 for as long as it stays frightened, which costs it actions for at least two rounds. It heightens by 2d6 per rank. Through Spellstrike it combines a top-tier damage payload with slow and fear in one activity, which few spells at any rank do. Mindless creatures and those immune to fear or mental effects ignore it.")
s('Prismatic Shield', '000503', 'ADD', "Prismatic Shield costs one action and lasts until Cyrus's next turn. Melee attackers suffer a random prismatic beam, arrows and other small projectiles are blocked outright, and any spell targeting him must beat his spell DC with a counteract check. As a final action after a Spellstrike, it makes him very hard to hurt for a round. It takes a rank-9 slot each fight.")
s('Word of Revision', '000503', 'BDD', "Word of Revision is a reaction that rerolls an ally's failed save, turns a critical failure into a failure, or keeps an ally at 1 Hit Point instead of 0. It can prevent a death or a disabling effect once per creature per day. It takes a rank-6 slot that could hold a spell he casts on his own turn, which is a real cost, but as the one strong reaction he holds besides Reactive Strike it is excellent.")
s('Binding Muzzle', '030000', 'BAD', "Binding Muzzle stops a creature using bites, breath weapons or anything else from its mouth, for a round on a success and a minute on a failure. Against a dragon or another breath-weapon monster that is a fight-changing answer, which makes it an excellent scroll for that specific encounter. At rank 5 it can target five creatures.")
s('Take Your Places', '000050', 'BCD', "Take Your Places teleports up to four willing creatures anywhere within 60 feet for two actions, even to places they can't see if they have been there. It can set up a flank, rescue several surrounded allies at once or move the whole front line into position before the enemy acts.")
s("Infiltrator's Tunnel", '000034', 'BAC', "Infiltrator's Tunnel opens two linked portals up to 60 feet apart for a minute, and from rank 6 lets five allies use them. It gets the party through a wall or into a sealed room during an infiltration, which suits the campaign's intrigue.")
s('Disruptive Transfer', '002040', 'BDD', "Disruptive Transfer teleports Cyrus anywhere within his Speed that he can see, and dazzles creatures next to where he left on a failed Will save. With Laughing Shadow's Speed it reaches far, and it doesn't trigger reactions. Dimensional Assault does a similar job without a slot, so this is for fights where his Focus Points are spent.")

s('Force Rain', '400000', 'ADD', "Force Rain is flexible and deals force damage, which almost nothing resists. The one-action version hits a single square with a basic Reflex save, so it works as a third action after a Spellstrike without any multiple attack penalty. The two-action version deals Fireball-level damage in a 10-foot burst, small enough to place with Expansive Spellstrike without catching Cyrus at 10-foot reach. The three-action version deals guaranteed damage with no save, which finishes off a group of weakened enemies. It heightens well in every version.")

# attack-roll payloads reviewed against each other
s('Blazing Bolt', '400000', 'ADD', "Through Spellstrike, Blazing Bolt uses its two-action version: fire damage on Aspera's attack roll that rises by 2d6 per rank. That is the same damage per rank as Briny Bolt, which also blinds the target, and Shocking Grasp deals more at low ranks, so Blazing Bolt is not his best attack payload. Its real strength is as a direct cast when he can't reach melee: three actions fire three full-damage rays at three different enemies, each making its own attack roll before the multiple attack penalty applies, which is one of the strongest ranged turns available to him at any rank.")
s('Blood Feast', '400100', 'ACD', "Blood Feast deals more piercing damage than Briny Bolt at the same rank, adds bleed on a critical hit and gives Cyrus temporary Hit Points equal to half the damage dealt. It is a touch spell, so Spellstrike delivers it through Aspera's reach on his Strike's attack roll. From rank 5 it is one of his strongest attack payloads, and the temporary Hit Points help him stay in melee. The spell describes the caster's head splitting into a maw; delivered through Spellstrike, it can simply be the blade drawing the target's blood, and it has no unholy trait.")
s('Percussive Impact', '300000', 'BDD', "Percussive Impact is an attack payload whose damage rises by 4d8 every two ranks, so it starts behind Briny Bolt but overtakes it at ranks 7 and 9, where it roughly matches Blood Feast. Its splash damage is small enough to ignore, though it does touch adjacent allies. It is a strong choice for his highest slots late in the campaign.")
s('Boomerang Shot', '400000', 'BDD', "Boomerang Shot deals heavy bludgeoning damage and ignores concealment and most cover, which matters for a direct cast against a hidden or sheltered archer. Through Spellstrike its damage is close to Briny Bolt's at ranks 5 and 7, without the blinding, so its main value is that direct cast.")
s('Polar Ray', '402000', 'BDD', "Polar Ray deals cold damage on a hit and leaves the target drained 2, which lowers its Fortitude saves and Hit Points for the rest of the day. Through Spellstrike it deals noticeably less than a rank-8 Briny Bolt, so its value is the drained condition before a Fortitude spell such as Boil Blood.")
s('Widow’s Bite', '203000', 'BDD', "Widow's Bite is a touch attack spell, so Spellstrike delivers it at Aspera's reach on his Strike's attack roll. A hit deals 1d4 piercing and 3d4 persistent poison damage and leaves the target enfeebled 1 until the poison ends, which lowers its Strength-based attacks and damage; a critical hit doubles both, including the persistent damage. It heightens only every two ranks, by 1d4 piercing and 2d4 persistent poison, so its damage falls behind Briny Bolt and Blood Feast. Its value is the enfeebled condition against a strong melee enemy, and it pairs well with Sure Strike for the doubled persistent damage. Many undead and constructs are immune to poison, which removes both effects.")
s("Eagle's Cry", '214000', 'ACC', "Eagle's Cry is a 30-foot cone of sonic damage with a Fortitude save, and every creature that doesn't critically succeed is frightened: 1 on a success, 2 on a failure, and fleeing for a round on a critical failure. That makes it one of the few area spells whose debuff lands even when the enemies save, and it has no mental or emotion trait, so mindless creatures are still frightened. With Aspera's reach, Expansive Spellstrike can start the cone from a square next to the target and point it away from allies. Its damage rises by 3d8 every two ranks, so it is mainly a debuff. Frightened and the sickened condition from Blister Bomb are both status penalties and don't stack, so Cyrus needs only one of the two in a fight: Eagle's Cry for enemies spread in front of him, Blister Bomb for a tight group near allies.")
